\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Simple Spaces, Better Living</h2>\n            <p>A clutter-free, well-lit home makes daily life easier. Thoughtful modern interior design brings that calm to every room.</p><p>Want your Rajokri home to feel lighter and less cluttered? <a href=\"/rajokri/contact\">Contact 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}